msgid "Biz haqimizda"
msgstr "About us"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:17
msgid ""
"Kiyishni istaydigan grafik futbolkalar — Oʻzbekiston boʻylab yetkazib "
"beriladi."
msgstr "Graphic T-shirts you’ll actually want to wear — delivered anywhere in Uzbekistan."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:19
msgid ""
"GRAPHIX bitta narsa bilan shugʻullanadi — grafik futbolka bilan. Dizayn "
"egningizda ham ekrandagidek koʻrinishi kerak. Shuning uchun mahsulot "
"sahifasida eng katta joy rasmga beriladi, mato, zichlik va bosma usuli esa "
"alohida yozib qoʻyiladi."
msgstr "GRAPHIX does one thing: the graphic T-shirt. A design should look as good on you as it does on screen, so the image gets the most room on every product page, and the fabric, weight and print method are spelled out separately."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:21
msgid ""
"Doʻkonga chiqadigan har bir futbolka avval tekshiriladi: print ham, mato ham "
"oʻzimiz kiyadigan darajada boʻlishi kerak."
msgstr "Every T-shirt is checked before it goes on sale: the print and the fabric both have to be good enough for us to wear ourselves."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:23
msgid "Olishdan oldin bilasiz"
msgstr "Know before you buy"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:24
msgid ""
"Oʻlcham jadvalidagi qiymatlar kiyimning oʻzidan oʻlchangan. Sharhni faqat "
"mahsulotni olgan xaridor qoldiradi va har bir sharh chop etilishidan oldin "
"tekshiriladi. Yetkazib berish narxi va muddati buyurtma berishdan oldin "
"koʻrsatiladi."
msgstr "The size chart is measured from the garments themselves. Only a customer who received a product can review it, and every review is read before it goes up. Delivery prices and times are shown before you order."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:26 .\templates\core\home.html:20
msgid "Oʻz dizayningiz"
msgstr "Your own design"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:27
msgid ""
"Xohlagan rasm yoki gʻoyangiz bor-u, kolleksiyamizda topolmadingizmi? Boshqa "
"joydan qidirib vaqt yoʻqotmang — bizga yozing. Buyurtma asosida individual "
"dizaynli futbolka tayyorlaymiz."
msgstr ""
"Got an image or an idea we don't carry? Don't waste time looking elsewhere — "
"write to us. We print custom designs to order."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:31 .\templates\core\contact.html:3
#: .\templates\core\contact.html:19 .\templates\core\size_guide.html:71
#: .\templates\partials\_drawer.html:25 .\templates\partials\_footer.html:21
#: .\templates\partials\_nav.html:14
msgid "Bogʻlanish"
msgstr "Contact"

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:20
msgid ""
"Buyurtma, oʻlcham yoki oʻz dizayningiz haqida savol boʻlsa — yozing. "
"Yozganingiz toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri doʻkon egasiga boradi."
msgstr "A question about an order, a size or your own design? Write to us — your message goes straight to the owner of the store."

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:27
msgid "Mavzu"
msgstr "Theme"

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:32
msgid "Xabar"
msgstr "Message"

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:34
msgid ""
"Buyurtma haqida yozsangiz, uning raqamini koʻrsating — masalan, "
